# SYSTEM TRACK for the ad encounter (issue 091a). Not in the record player: it
# is played on the encounter bus from the entrance's hit chord (frame 32) while
# the card is open. Key of G (the entrance's pulse run), 135 bpm, 16 beats = ~7s
# a pass, four passes then a fade. It starts on the downbeat the hit lands on.
title: Encounter Battle
note: System track for ad encounters. Not in the record player.
tempo: 135

